edge/dist/
# Setup-wizard answers. They hold a box's address and whatever credentials that
# wizard collected, and this repo is public — one `git add -A` is all it takes.
# Globbed rather than listed: the next wizard should not have to remember this.
.*-setup.env
# The iOS signing override: a personal Apple team id and the bundle id its
# profile covers. Ignored rather than tracked so it cannot be committed to a
# public repo, and — the reason it is a separate file at all — so it cannot be
# swept into an unrelated `git stash` the way the same edits in the .pbxproj
# were. apps/ios/Signing.local.xcconfig.example is the tracked template.
apps/ios/Signing.local.xcconfig
